sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>FE: Buka halaman "Laporan"
  FE->>API: GET /api/v1/reports
  API->>DB: SELECT reports WHERE user_id = ?
  DB-->>API: Daftar laporan
  API-->>FE: 200 OK [reports]
  FE-->>U: Tampilkan daftar laporan
  opt Lihat / unduh laporan
    U->>FE: Klik salah satu laporan
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/reports/{id}
    API->>DB: Ambil isi laporan
    DB-->>API: Data laporan
    API-->>FE: 200 OK {report}
    FE-->>U: Tampilkan / unduh laporan (PDF)
  end
  opt Hapus laporan
    U->>FE: Klik "Hapus"
    FE->>API: DELETE /api/v1/reports/{id}
    API->>DB: Hapus laporan
    DB-->>API: Berhasil
    API-->>FE: 200 OK
    FE-->>U: Perbarui daftar laporan
  end
